## IMPORT ALIAS: @/* → src/*

## WRITTEN FILES — do not rewrite
src/app/layout.tsx Plus_Jakarta_Sans(--font-jakarta) + Lora(--font-lora)
<html lang=en class="{jakarta.var} {lora.var}">
<body class="font-jakarta antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col">
Order: Providers > Navbar + main + Footer
src/app/providers.tsx "use client" | SessionProvider > {children} +
CartDrawer + ComparisonBar + CookieBanner +
Toaster(pos:top-right, bg:#0f172a, rounded:12px)
src/app/page.tsx Hero,TrustStrip,CategoriesGrid,PromoBanners,
Testimonials,NewsletterSection — BUG-1: no products
src/app/globals.css --foreground:#0f172a, smooth scroll, 6px scrollbar
src/middleware.ts /account→/login(!session) | /admin→/(role!=admin)

## DESIGN TOKENS (tailwind.config.ts)
brand.DEFAULT #2563EB | brand.dark #1D4ED8 | brand.light #EFF6FF
teal.DEFAULT #0D9488 | teal.light #F0FDFA
font-jakarta (Plus Jakarta Sans) | font-lora (Lora serif)
animate-float — translateY 0→-12px, 3s ease-in-out infinite
next/image domains: cdn.sanity.io, images.unsplash.com

## ZUSTAND (src/store/index.ts)
useCartStore | useWishlistStore | useCurrencyStore
useCompareStore (no persist) | useRecentlyViewedStore

## HARD RULES — always follow
R-01 strict TS — no any, no @ts-ignore, no ! without null check
R-02 "use client" only when needed — default Server Component
R-03 data-testid on all interactive elements
R-04 aria-label on all icon-only buttons
R-05 useHasMounted() before Zustand localStorage reads
R-06 React.memo() on ProductCard + list-rendered product components
R-07 NO dynamic Tailwind: use MAP={2:"grid-cols-2",3:"...",4:"..."}
R-08 forms: react-hook-form + zodResolver only
R-09 API routes: Zod input + full try/catch + verifyCsrf + rateLimit
R-10 NEVER accept amount in payment routes — calculate from Sanity
R-11 NEVER return SDK error.message to client
R-12 import "server-only" in all src/lib/ (except utils.ts, env.ts)
R-13 non-blocking email: Promise.all([...]).catch(console.error)
R-14 revalidatePath() directly — never HTTP self-call
R-15 order numbers: SM-[A-F0-9]{8} via crypto.randomUUID()
R-16 Sanity: sanityReadClient(CDN,no token) + sanityWriteClient(no CDN,token)
R-17 Stripe webhook: sync before 200, return 500 on DB fail
R-18 every page exports generateMetadata()

