BUG-2 Navbar.tsx: always shows Sign In — use useSession()
BUG-3 docker-compose: remove version key + fix REDIS_URL with password
BUG-4 ProductGrid.tsx: dynamic Tailwind `grid-cols-${n}` — use COL_MAP
